ssl-server.pem
playground-*/pnpm-lock.yaml
# non-SPA mode folders are generated: the CLI auto-installs a missing mode
# on "quasar dev/build -m <mode>" (SSR picks the hono webserver when it
# cannot prompt), which the e2e suite relies on
playground-*/src-*/
# scaffolded into the app by the PWA mode installation
playground-*/public/icons/
# pristine-config backups the e2e suite self-heals from after a killed run
playground-*/quasar.config.*.e2e-backup
# written by the e2e qe2e-extension step and removed by its cleanup
# (the clean step also heals leftovers of a killed run)
playground-*/quasar.extensions.json
playground-*/qe2e-rendered/
